⏺ All three changes are in, verified, and both copies are in sync:

  1. Trace never fades — the orange line now persists indefinitely (no more
     2.5-revolution expiry). It's drawn into an offscreen canvas so the page
     stays smooth even after tens of thousands of points, and it re-renders
     correctly when you resize the window or switch light/dark theme. Only Reset
     clears it.
  2. Ratio is now adjustable — a new Cycles per revolution n slider in the
     Motion section (0.5 to 24, in half steps, default 5). The formula is now
